                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;light-font&quot;>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-32-reg&quot;>Our work culture is the foundation for everything we do. That is why we create an environment that is diverse and inclusive, and in which all employees feel comfortable, can trust, and support each other. That’s why we are awarded a “Great Place to Work” in the medium-sized company category for the eleventh time in a row. &lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;Find out more:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.en.greatplacetowork.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>Great Place to Work&lt;/a>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;light-font&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
