                                    text="&lt;p>In 2025, AbbVie was recognized with the &amp;quot;Kyan Wellbeing Award&amp;quot; 2025 for strategically prioritizing the well-being of AbbVie employees and proactively promoting it with holistic concepts. Kyan Health is the leading digital health company from Switzerland in the field of mental health and mental well-being in the workplace.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
